  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a> for the given <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mapping.context 包中\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.mapping.context 包中\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> exposed by the registered <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "返回所有已注册的<a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>所暴露的信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given type.",
      "translation": "返回给定类型的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>type</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>type</code> 不得为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>property</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>property</code> - 不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Executes the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a> on the given <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> based on the\ngiven type. Considers all <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>s for lookup. This method will create a new\n<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> in case there is only a single <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> registered.",
      "translation": "根据给定的类型，在指定的<a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>和<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>上执行给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a>。该方法会考虑所有注册的<a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>进行查找。如果仅注册了一个<a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，则此方法将创建一个新的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> refers to in case it's an association.\nFor direct aggregate references, that's simply the entity for the <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>'s actual type. If the\nproperty type is not an entity - as it might rather refer to the identifier type - we either use the reference's\ndefined target type and fall back to trying to find a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> identified by the\n<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>'s actual type.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 所引用的 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>，如果它是一个关联关系。\n对于直接的聚合引用，这仅仅是 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 实际类型对应的实体。如果属性类型不是实体——它可能指的是标识符类型——则使用引用定义的自标类型，并回退尝试查找由 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 的实际类型标识的 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Executes the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a> on the given <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> based on the\ngiven type.",
      "translation": "根据给定的类型，在指定的<a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>和<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>上执行给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given type. Will consider all <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>s registered but\nreturn Optional#empty() in case none of the registered ones already have a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>\nregistered for the given type.",
      "translation": "返回给定类型的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。该方法会考虑所有已注册的<a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，但如果没有任何一个已注册的上下文为给定类型注册了<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>，则返回 Optional#empty()。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given type. Will consider all <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>s registered and\ncreate a new <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> in case none of the registered ones already have it registered for the given\ntype, if there is only one context available.",
      "translation": "返回给定类型的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。将检查所有已注册的<a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.context 中的接口\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，如果只有一个上下文可用且其中没有针对该类型注册任何实体，则创建一个新的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Value object to access <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> instances managed by <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "用于访问由<a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>管理的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>实例的值对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> refers to in case it's an association.",
      "translation": "如果给定的 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 是一个关联，则返回它所引用的 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> ultimately refers to.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>最终指向的类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> ultimately refers to. In case it's of a unique identifier\ntype of entity known it'll return the entity type.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>最终引用的类型。如果它是已知实体的唯一标识符类型，则返回该实体类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../MappingException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\">MappingException</a></code> - if the <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> cannot be found or\n          <a href=\"MappingContext.html#getPersistentEntity(java.lang.Class)\"><code>created</code></a> by the underlying <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"../MappingException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\">MappingException</a></code> - 如果找不到 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>，或者它是由底层的 <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> 创建的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html#iterator()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">iterator</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Iterable</a>&lt;<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\">PersistentEntity</a>&lt;?, ? extends <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\">PersistentProperty</a>&lt;?&gt;&gt;&gt;</code>",
